        // ---- edge: diagonal-only symmetric BSR ----
        //
        // ONLY diagonal blocks are populated -> in bsrMatVecSym the `if (bi != bj)` mirrored-write
        // branch is NEVER taken. This isolates the diagonal path (the branch that would silently
